# 📚 Ustaad AI — Exam Prep for Pakistani Matric & Inter Students

Upload a chapter from your own textbook and practice board-style questions.
Answers are checked **only against your chapter** and explained in
**English, اردو (Urdu), or Roman Urdu**.

Built with [Streamlit](https://streamlit.io) and Google Gemini (via
[Google AI Studio](https://aistudio.google.com)).

## Features

- Upload PDF, Word, TXT, or **photos of book pages** (read with Gemini vision)
- Practice questions in Pakistani board style: MCQ, short, long, true/false, fill in the blanks, definition, reason
- Instant marking with score, missing points, mistakes, model answer, and a revision tip
- Understands answers written in English, Urdu, or Roman Urdu
- Chapter summary, glossary, and likely exam questions
- "Samajh nahi aya" explainer with Pakistani real-life examples
- Flashcards
- Progress chart by topic and a 3-day revision plan
- Proper Urdu (Nastaliq) font with right-to-left display

## Run locally

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/ustaad-ai.git
cd ustaad-ai
python -m venv venv
# Windows: venv\Scripts\activate      Mac/Linux: source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Get a free API key at <https://aistudio.google.com/apikey>, then create
`.streamlit/secrets.toml` (this file is git-ignored):

```toml
GEMINI_API_KEY = "paste-your-key-here"
```

Start the app:

```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

## Deploy on Streamlit Community Cloud

1. Push this repo to GitHub.
2. Go to <https://share.streamlit.io>, click **New app**, choose the repo, branch `main`, file `app.py`.
3. Open **Advanced settings → Secrets** and paste `GEMINI_API_KEY = "your-key"`.
4. Click **Deploy**.

Optional secret: `GEMINI_MODEL` (default `gemini-2.5-flash`).

## Project structure

```
app.py                         main Streamlit app
requirements.txt               dependencies
.streamlit/secrets.toml.example  template for your API key
.gitignore                     keeps secrets out of GitHub
```

## Important notes

- **Never commit your API key.** Keep it in `secrets.toml` or Streamlit Cloud Secrets.
- AI can make mistakes. Your textbook and teacher are the final authority.
- Scanned PDFs cannot be read as text. Upload photos of the pages instead.
- Chapters are processed per session and not stored. Do not upload copyrighted books to a public repo.
- Each session is limited to 80 AI calls to protect the free quota.

## Roadmap

Handwritten answer photos, voice answers in Urdu, timer mode, mock board papers,
spaced repetition, teacher mode with class quiz codes.
